Subject: New ISO 639 language identifier - Lojban
Date: Tue, 2 Sep 2003 10:07:01 +0200

The ISO 639 Registration Authorities' Joint Advisory Committee (JAC) has
approved the following item:

Alpha-3 identifier: jbo
(no alpha-2 identifier)
English name: Lojban
French name: lojban
Indigenous name: la lojban.

Lojban is an artificial language.

Best regards,
Håvard Hjulstad

